PaymentRails_PreviewExecutionNative
├── given native is pending and the wrapped balance is zero
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_NativePendingWrap carrying the pending amount
├── given native is pending and the wrapped balance is below minBalance
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_NativePendingWrap
├── given native is pending and the wrapped balance meets minBalance
│   └── it should preview the wrapped balance normally
├── given native is pending but wrapping would still not meet minBalance
│   └── it should revert with the underlying balance reason
├── given minBalance is zero with native pending and no wrapped balance
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_NativePendingWrap
├── given minBalance is zero with native pending and some wrapped balance
│   └── it should preview the wrapped balance normally
├── given no native is pending and the wrapped balance is zero
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_ZeroAmount
├── given native is pending for a different token
│   └── it should not affect that token's preview
└── given the native has been wrapped
    └── it should preview the full balance
